==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*šьpъtati}}, of onomatopoeic origin. Cognates include {{cog|uk|шепта́ти}}, {{cog|be|шапта́ць}}, {{cog|pl|szeptać}}, {{cog|bg|шептя́}}, etc.

===Pronunciation===
